sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant B as Browser
    participant API as Backend
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant FS as File storage
    B->>API: DELETE /account {password}
    API->>DB: throttle check (per account and address)
    API->>DB: verify password (BCrypt)
    API->>DB: DELETE user → cascades to sessions, documents, pages,<br/>results, medicines, terms, jobs, audit rows (one transaction)
    API->>FS: after commit: delete the user's folder
    API-->>B: 204 + cleared refresh cookie
